# Captain Pike has a characteristic-defining P/T equal to distinct land names you control; the top land may be played once it enters, repeated Forests count once, and Bot2's Plains does not count.
# The ability defines its P/T in every zone (CR 604.3): one Forest makes the Pike in hand 1/1, and a second Pike at the
# bottom of the library is 2/2 at the end.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Captain Pike, Fullness of Time
Forest
Island
Mountain
Island
Plains
Forest
Island x10
Captain Pike, Fullness of Time

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot1.Hand.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Power = 1
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Cast
Bot1.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Library.Island.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Power = 2
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Power = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Tapped = false
Bot1.Library.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Power = 2
Bot1.Library.Captain Pike, Fullness of Time.Toughness = 2
